[1m[38;2;242;198;94m### The Big Picture: Transitioning from Mark I to Mark II[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m[0m
[38;2;238;244;255mIn the 24-hour sprint, we built a [1m[38;2;242;198;94mproof-of-principle benchtop rig[0m[38;2;238;244;255m using consumer DLP projection and hand-soldered photodiodes. Over 6 months, we upgrade every single layer of the stack to medical/pre-clinical grade:[0m
