[38;2;238;244;255m* [1m[38;2;242;198;94mDeliverable at Day 180:[0m[38;2;238;244;255m A turnkey, roll-in clinical cart with autoclavable surgical draping, verified in live animal craniotomies, and packaged with an FDA Investigational Device Exemption (IDE) pre-submission packet.[0m
