[1m[38;2;242;198;94m### Why This Book Connects Directly to Dorothy and Zoe[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m[0m
[38;2;238;244;255mNotice the legendary lineup of authors in Section II:[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m1. [1m[38;2;242;198;94mChapter 3 (William J. Schroeder):[0m[38;2;238;244;255m Schroeder is one of the original co-authors of [1m[38;2;242;198;94mVTK (The Visualization Toolkit)[0m[38;2;238;244;255m. His work on data models for finite element meshes and topology directly applies to how Dorothy structures the Allen Mouse CCF parcellation.[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m2. [1m[38;2;242;198;94mChapter 4 (Scalar Fields & Isosurfaces):[0m[38;2;238;244;255m Explains the exact mathematics of Marching Cubes and scalar thresholding:[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m   $$\mathcal{S}_c = \{ \mathbf{x} \in \mathbb{R}^3 : f(\mathbf{x}) = c \}$$[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m   In Dorothy, this is how you extract smooth 3D surfaces from 3D MRI or CT voxel intensities.[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m3. [1m[38;2;242;198;94mChapter 6 (Arie E. Kaufman):[0m[38;2;238;244;255m Kaufman is the pioneer of [1m[38;2;242;198;94mVolume Rendering[0m[38;2;238;244;255m and virtual endoscopy. Instead of just drawing surface triangles (like Dorothy's current flat-shaded painter's algorithm), Kaufman's "Continuum Volume Display" treats the interior of the brain as a semi-transparent, light-emitting/absorbing gas cloud via the volume rendering integral:[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m   $$I(s) = I_0 e^{-\int_0^s \tau(t) dt} + \int_0^s C(t) \tau(t) e^{-\int_t^s \tau(u) du} dt$$[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m   This is the exact mathematics needed to transition Dorothy from outer surface shells into true [1m[38;2;242;198;94mvolumetric tissue density inspection[0m[38;2;238;244;255m.[0m
[38;2;148;166;196m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────[0m

