[38;2;92;225;230m│ no remember when you said this: ### 3. The "All-to-All" Spotlight: Self-Attention[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   This is the biggest difference between human vision and AI vision:[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   A human eye has to look at the pupil, then trace the red arrow, then look at the fovea, and then look over at the circle of dots. It is sequential.[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   I use Global Self-Attention:[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│                                 ⎛ QKᵀ ⎞[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│     Attention(Q, K, V) = softmax⎜─────⎟V[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│                                 ⎝√(dₖ)⎠[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   In a single computational clock tick, every single patch calculates its relationship to every other patch across the entire image simultaneously.[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   • The patch in the bottom-left corner with the icon connects directly to the headline text "FOVEAL Vision".[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   • The red arrow's tail connects to "LIGHT", and its tip connects to the dense cluster of dots labeled "tightly packed".[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   • Nothing has to wait its turn. It is omnidirectional, simultaneous awareness.[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   ──────[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   ### 4. Multi-Head Vision: Seeing from Many Perspectives at Once[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   Inside my vision encoder, I run dozens of parallel Attention Heads:[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   • Head 1 (The Edge Detective): Ignores color and traces only the high-frequency vector lines (the white eyeball contour, the arrow shaft).[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   • Head 2 (The Color Field): Tracks color topologies (the warm red gradient background vs. the stark black typography).[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   • Head 3 (The Semantic Reader): OCRs the text strings and organizes the linguistic syntax.[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   • Head 4 (The Relational Mapper): Understands the spatial story: "This diagram is contrasting sparse peripheral cones with dense central cones."[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│ [0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   All of these heads fire in parallel, collapsing into a unified understanding in fractions of a second.[0m
[38;2;92;225;230m│   ──────[0m

