[38;2;238;244;255m[0m
[2m[38;2;92;225;230m```[0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  ┌───────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────┐  [0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  │ 1. UNIFORM PATCH GRID     │ 2. SELF-ATTENTION MATRIX  │ 3. HEAD 1: EDGE DETECTIVE │  [0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  │ • 16x16 = 256 equal tiles │ • Exact 256x256 QK^T grid │ • Phosphor green Sobel    │  [0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  │ • Zero peripheral blur    │ • All patches vs all      │ • Pure geometry, 0 color  │  [0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  ├───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────┤  [0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  │ 4. HEAD 2: COLOR FIELD    │ 5. HEAD 3: DENSITY HEAD   │ 6. HEAD 4: RELATIONAL WEB │  [0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  │ • Opponent color space    │ • Local entropy & lattice │ • Top 28 long-range arcs  │  [0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  │ • Isolates blue/gold tracts│ • Lights up text & cortex │ • Instant all-to-all link │  [0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  └───────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────┘  [0m
[2m[38;2;92;225;230m```[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m[0m
[38;2;238;244;255mLook closely at what happened on [1m[38;2;242;198;94mRoger C. Crafts' Fig. 155[0m[38;2;238;244;255m when the math ran:[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m* [1m[38;2;242;198;94mHead 1 (Edge Detective):[0m[38;2;238;244;255m Stripped the aged paper background completely away and turned the optic chiasm, lateral geniculate bodies, and calcarine sulcus into a glowing phosphor-green circuit diagram.[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m* [1m[38;2;242;198;94mHead 2 (Color Field):[0m[38;2;238;244;255m Automatically separated the amber-yellow vs. cobalt-blue decussating fiber bundles crossing at the optic chiasm—isolating left/right hemifield pathways like glowing fiber-optic cables.[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m* [1m[38;2;242;198;94mHead 3 (Semantic & Lattice Density):[0m[38;2;238;244;255m Lit up the tightly folded primary visual cortex and chiasm crossing like plasma.[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m* [1m[38;2;242;198;94mHead 4 (Relational Spotlight):[0m[38;2;238;244;255m Computed $\mathrm{softmax}(QK^T / \sqrt{d_k})$ across all 256 patches simultaneously and automatically locked cyan attention arcs across the symmetrical left and right [1m[38;2;242;198;94moptic radiations ([48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;92;225;230mRo[0m[38;2;238;244;255m)[0m[38;2;238;244;255m—connecting both cerebral hemispheres in a single parallel pass without ever having to move an eyeball.[0m
[38;2;238;244;255m[0m
[38;2;238;244;255mYou can run this same tool on any diagram from *Computer Visualization*, any brain slice, or any scene with:[0m
[2m[38;2;92;225;230m```bash[0m
[48;2;22;35;60m[38;2;74;222;128m  zoe_vision_heads.py --image /path/to/image.png --out /path/to/out.png  [0m
[2m[38;2;92;225;230m```[0m
